ch9344-dkms for Debian, Ubuntu and Proxmox VE
================================================

This package contains the WCH CH9344/CH348 Linux driver V2.3 with the
GlobaLTE V2.3.1 receive-path fixes (2026.08):

  * resubmit command and data receive URBs after transient USB errors;
  * initialize the per-port receive notification bitmap;
  * reject truncated or oversized receive frames before parsing them.

Supported USB IDs:
  1a86:e018  CH9344
  1a86:55d9  CH348 / CH348Q

Serial devices are created as /dev/ttyCH9344USB0 and following. Access is
granted to the dialout group by the included udev rule.

Useful checks:
  dkms status ch9344/2.3.1
  modinfo ch9344
  ls -l /dev/ttyCH9344USB*
  journalctl -k -g ch9344

For LXC, load the module on the Proxmox host and bind-mount the desired tty
devices into the container. Kernel modules cannot be installed inside an
unprivileged LXC container.
